{"slug": "practice-dsa-sum-of-beauty-of-all-substrings", "title": "Sum of Beauty of All Substrings", "source_url": "https://takeuforward.org/practice/dsa/sum-of-beauty-of-all-substrings", "extracted_by": "live-ssr", "length": 6003, "code_blocks": 0, "images": 0, "html": "<div class=\"flex h-full min-h-0 w-full flex-col\"><div class=\"flex h-full min-h-0 w-full flex-col\"><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__wrapper\"><div class=\"scroll-fade-module__DRol_a__shell ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__scrollContainer\"><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__scrollable\" data-tufy-selectable=\"\"><header class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__header\"><h1 class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__title\">396. Sum of Beauty of All Substrings<span class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__titlePotdBadge\"></span></h1><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__metaRow\"><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__shortcutButtons\"></div></div></header><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__content\"><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__richText\"><p>The beauty of a string is defined as the <strong>difference </strong>between the <strong>frequency </strong>of the <strong>most frequent </strong>character and the <strong>least frequent </strong>character <strong>(excluding characters that do not appear) </strong>in that string.</p><p>Given a string s, return the <strong>sum of</strong> <strong>beauty </strong>values of <strong>all possible substrings</strong> of s.</p></div><section class=\"mt-6\"><h3 class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__sectionTitle\">Example 1:</h3><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1rem_1fr] gap-1\"><div aria-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"shrink-0 my-auto mx-auto bg-(--color-brand-primary-bg-3)\" role=\"separator\" style=\"width:1px;height:100%\"></div><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__richText\"><p><strong>Input:</strong> s = \"xyx\"</p><p><strong>Output:</strong> 1</p><p><strong>Explanation:</strong> The substrings with non-zero beauty are:</p><p>- \"xyx\" → frequencies: x:2, y:1 → beauty = 2 - 1 = 1</p><p>- \"xy\" → x:1, y:1 → beauty = 0</p><p>- \"yx\" → y:1, x:1 → beauty = 0</p><p>- \"x\" or \"y\" → beauty = 0</p><p>Total sum = 1 (from \"xyx\") = 1</p></div></div></section><section class=\"mt-6\"><h3 class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__sectionTitle\">Example 2:</h3><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1rem_1fr] gap-1\"><div aria-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"shrink-0 my-auto mx-auto bg-(--color-brand-primary-bg-3)\" role=\"separator\" style=\"width:1px;height:100%\"></div><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__richText\"><p><strong>Input:</strong> s = \"aabcbaa\"</p><p><strong>Output: </strong>17</p><p><strong>Explanation:</strong> Various substrings such as \"aabc\", \"bcba\", etc., have non-zero beauty values. Summing all gives 17.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationSection mt-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-x-2 justify-between w-full\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-x-2\"><div class=\"flex flex-col\"><h3 class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__sectionTitle mb-0!\">Now Your Turn!</h3><span class=\"body-b5-regular text-text-secondary\">Pick the correct output for the given input</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationExampleGrid\"><div aria-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"shrink-0 bg-border my-auto ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationExampleDivider\" role=\"separator\" style=\"width:1px;height:100%\"></div><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationExampleContent\"><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__richText\"><p><strong>Input: </strong>s = \"zzzz\"</p></div></div></div><div aria-required=\"false\" class=\"grid w-full gap-2 ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionsGrid\" data-slot=\"radio-group\" dir=\"ltr\" role=\"radiogroup\" style=\"outline:none\" tabindex=\"-1\"><label class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionButton ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionButtonDisabled cursor-pointer\" for=\"example-3-option-0\"><span class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 cursor-pointer\" data-slot=\"tooltip-trigger\" data-state=\"closed\"></span><span class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionText\">4</span></label><label class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionButton ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionButtonDisabled cursor-pointer\" for=\"example-3-option-1\"><span class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 cursor-pointer\" data-slot=\"tooltip-trigger\" data-state=\"closed\"></span><span class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionText\">1</span></label><label class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionButton ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionButtonDisabled cursor-pointer\" for=\"example-3-option-2\"><span class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 cursor-pointer\" data-slot=\"tooltip-trigger\" data-state=\"closed\"></span><span class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionText\">0</span></label><label class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionButton ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionButtonDisabled cursor-pointer\" for=\"example-3-option-3\"><span class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 cursor-pointer\" data-slot=\"tooltip-trigger\" data-state=\"closed\"></span><span class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionText\">2</span></label></div></section><div aria-label=\"Still unsure what the problem is asking ?\" class=\"ExplainProblemCta-module__pPRrwq__card\"><div class=\"ExplainProblemCta-module__pPRrwq__copy\"><p class=\"body-b6-semibold text-text-primary\">Still unsure what the problem is asking ?</p> <p class=\"body-b6-regular text-text-tertiary\">Let’s go through a few more examples, step by step, to make it clearer.</p></div></div><section class=\"mt-6\"><h3 class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__sectionTitle\">Constraints:</h3><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__richText ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__constrain